OL,3,GNEWSAA14 blocked eastbound after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A14 has been blocked eastbound
OL,7,Fafter a multi-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police said the
OL,10,Fcollision took place near junction 25
OL,11,Ffor Bar Hill, near where the road
OL,12,Fsplits to join the M11.
OL,14,FThere are delays of at least 20 minutes
OL,15,Fon the approach to the site and there
OL,16,Fis about a mile of congestion.
OL,18,FPolice are advising drivers to avoid
OL,19,Fthe area.
